Branch: REL_14_STABLE [69b973c65] 2026-11-09 06:21:00 -0800
-->
     <para>
      Disallow closing a portal that is still being set up
      (Michael Paquier)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8a2982de9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      This change forestalls various use-after-free issues.
     </para>

     <para>
      The <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> Project thanks
      Tomas Vondra
      for reporting this problem.
      (CVE-2026-116332)
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [7a910b4e1] 2026-11-09 06:20:33 -0800
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9ee5586a2] 2026-11-09 06:20:38 -0800
