Branch: REL_14_STABLE [84a4e2c18] 2026-11-09 06:21:01 -0800
-->
     <para>
      Forcibly close portals associated with transition tables at the end
      of the trigger function (Jeff Davis)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;983bcb768">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      This change avoids use-after-free hazards.
     </para>

     <para>
      The <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> Project thanks
      Peter Geoghegan
      for reporting this problem.
      (CVE-2026-120143)
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
