     <para>
      Prevent memory corruption after a large allocation in
      a <quote>generation</quote> memory context is freed
      (Heikki Linnakangas)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;53a34a4de">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      The <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> Project thanks
      Jayden Sarveshkumar
      for reporting this problem.
      (CVE-2026-116328)
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [27dfe0e34] 2026-11-09 06:20:29 -0800
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [418f055bf] 2026-11-09 06:20:35 -0800
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9c2cadacd] 2026-11-09 06:20:41 -0800
