Branch: REL_14_STABLE [d681b9f6a] 2026-11-09 06:20:59 -0800
-->
     <para>
      Fix buffer overrun in <function>tsvector_delete()</function>
      (Anthropic OSS program)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9c2cadacd">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      With crafted input, <function>tsvector_delete()</function> could be
      induced to write more bytes than it had allocated for its result.
     </para>

     <para>
      The <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> Project thanks
      the Anthropic OSS program
      for reporting this problem.
      (CVE-2026-116315)
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [c8d128858] 2026-11-09 06:20:29 -0800
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [f920b3c30] 2026-11-09 06:20:35 -0800
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [3e97c9a1f] 2026-11-09 06:20:41 -0800
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [7f8424ece] 2026-11-09 06:20:46 -0800
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [2d7573b00] 2026-11-09 06:20:50 -0800
