     <para>
      Cope with concurrent rowtype changes in PL/pgSQL record field
      assignment (Tom Lane)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6b1ca1333">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      The <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> Project thanks
      Claude and Ada Logics
      for reporting this problem.
      (CVE-2026-120151)
