     <para>
      Fix <literal>OLD</literal>/<literal>NEW</literal> aliases that
      <command>EXPLAIN</command> prints in <literal>RETURNING</literal>
      SubPlans (Henson Choi)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4ee8af2e8">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b049b4e7b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      In plans involving multiple aliases, the wrong one could be printed,
      resulting in confusing output.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
