Branch: REL_16_STABLE [658e15092] 2026-10-26 14:03:24 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [9df4d21ac] 2026-10-26 14:03:24 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f291e3336] 2026-10-26 14:03:24 -0400
-->
     <para>
      Fix PL/pgSQL's handling of <type>anycompatiblemultirange</type>
      arguments and results (Jeevan Chalke)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a34d61616">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      This type had not been added to PL/pgSQL's knowledge of polymorphic
      types, resulting in errors when trying to create or use a function
      declared with it.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [131444cd1] 2026-08-17 15:06:02 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [b6b4f5a64] 2026-08-17 15:06:02 -0400
