     <para>
      Harden PL/Perl and associated contrib modules
      against <quote>tied</quote> Perl hashes and arrays (Tom Lane)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;af659efcb">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b6193ff03">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Rely on <function>av_count()</function> to decide the length of a
      Perl array, rather than looking for a null pointer; and contrarily
      be more wary about unexpected null value pointers from array and
      hash fetches.  These cases are only known to arise in connection
      with <quote>tied</quote> objects.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [1c9efb57e] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5aed88ff9] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [94d625f5d] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [df9e6d7c7] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [72216a245] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
-->
     <para>
      Avoid memory leakage in <application>libpq</application> with
      repeated GSS connections (Matt Carter, Tom Lane)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;94d625f5d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [237176b79] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a16088305] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [d33449024] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a11bce64a] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
-->
     <para>
      Avoid incorrect behavior when <function>getopt_long()</function>
      rearranges a program's command line arguments (Sehrope Sarkuni)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d33449024">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      For example, <literal>vacuumdb postgres --jobs</literal>
      took <literal>postgres</literal> as the number of jobs instead of
      complaining that <literal>--jobs</literal> is missing its argument.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
