Branch: REL_18_STABLE [baa7b142a] 2026-08-17 09:21:08 +0900
-->
     <para>
      Fix <application>psql</application>'s display of <literal>REPLICA
      IDENTITY NOTHING</literal> table properties (Shinya Kato)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;baa7b142a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [0d7baa209] 2026-08-14 12:14:23 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [7f8de6d87] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [bcb776671] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [3828ab704] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [52f1eaae6] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [ed0a2b707] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f1204c1a7] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
-->
     <para>
      Ensure that <application>psql</application> counts all
      the <command>COPY FROM STDIN</command> commands appearing in a
      multi-query command string (Zsolt Parragi)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bcb776671">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      After the fix for CVE-2026-6464, <application>psql</application>
      would reject multiple <command>COPY FROM STDIN</command> commands
      appearing in a single string, because it was not expecting more than
      one <command>COPY</command> operation to occur.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
