Branch: REL_18_STABLE [fd9bb365d] 2026-08-21 12:37:20 +0900
-->
     <para>
      Prevent <application>psql</application> from getting confused if the
      argument of <command>\getresults</command> is invalid (Fujii Masao)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fd9bb365d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
