     <para>
      Make <application>psql</application> cope better with out-of-memory
      conditions during backslash command processing
      (Fujii Masao)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3f01b0c4a">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;789ae09a5">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
