     <para>
      In <application>pg_combinebackup</application>, reject out-of-range
      block numbers in incremental backup files (Peter Eisentraut)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;15e940a10">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      This omission meant that <application>pg_combinebackup</application>
      could crash on corrupted input.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [80931d131] 2026-10-02 17:02:21 +0900
