     <para>
      Make <application>pg_dump</application> dump column statistics
      targets for indexes backing constraints (Zsolt Parragi)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;37bbf5bba">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Formerly <application>pg_dump</application> would
      emit <literal>ALTER INDEX ... SET STATISTICS</literal> commands when
      needed for plain indexes, but not for indexes created
      via <literal>EXCLUDE</literal> constraints on expressions.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
