Branch: REL_14_STABLE [ae63671a7] 2026-09-26 12:56:14 -0400
-->
     <para>
      In <application>pg_dump</application>'s tar-format output, don't put
      invalid <literal>\restrict</literal>/<literal>\unrestrict</literal>
      commands into the <filename>restore.sql</filename> tar member (Pavel
      Kopylov)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2d748cfe3">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
