     <para>
      Make <application>pg_walsummary</application>'s
      <option>--quiet</option> switch suppress limit block output
      (Koshi Shibagaki)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1370a7832">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [e9c03f0f1] 2026-10-07 10:39:06 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [c84243d5b] 2026-10-07 10:39:15 +0900
