Branch: REL_17_STABLE [869c53ff8] 2026-10-07 10:39:32 +0900
-->
     <para>
      Make <application>reindexdb</application> error out cleanly if an
      index-level <literal>REINDEX CONCURRENTLY</literal> is requested
      with multiple jobs (Kirill Reshke)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;acccaf0d8">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Previously, this combination of options would lead to a server-side
      error, complaining that <literal>REINDEX CONCURRENTLY</literal>
      cannot run within a transaction block.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [72b9498df] 2026-11-06 23:31:41 +0900
