Branch: REL_16_STABLE [e9c45974a] 2026-11-06 23:33:15 +0900
-->
     <para>
      Fix <filename>contrib/file_fdw</filename> to not crash
      in <command>ANALYZE</command> when the table has column default clauses
      (Fujii Masao)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;813a74bc5">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8aea84d2b] 2026-11-04 11:18:49 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [f10d58d1f] 2026-11-04 11:19:39 +0900
