Branch: REL_17_STABLE [145a7175e] 2026-11-04 11:20:00 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [8ef710eb3] 2026-11-04 11:20:04 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [2117bdccf] 2026-11-04 11:20:09 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [42c6d2bc3] 2026-11-04 11:20:14 +0900
-->
     <para>
      Fix possible index corruption
      in <filename>contrib/pg_trgm</filename> GiST indexes
      (Nate Clark)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;60ccd730d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Combination of index entries could lose the flag identifying their
      format, so that subsequent index searches could miss matching rows.
     </para>

     <para>
      This fix does not repair existing indexes.  Users
      should <command>REINDEX</command>
      existing <literal>gist_trgm_ops</literal> indexes after updating.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
Branch: master [54635e689] 2026-10-15 12:04:27 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0fb192f1b] 2026-10-15 12:04:34 +0300
