Branch: REL_14_STABLE [b1c44848c] 2026-10-15 12:06:00 +0300
-->
     <para>
      Fix error check in timer setup on Windows (Sehrope Sarkuni)
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4d62ef92f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Failure to create a thread to manage timeouts was not detected,
      leading to silent failure of subsequent timeout requests.
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [a36e2f7cd] 2026-09-30 17:28:14 -0400
